sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client React
    participant A as routes/auth.ts
    participant P as Prisma
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    C->>A: POST /api/auth/login {email, password}
    A->>P: prisma.user.findUnique({ where: { email } })
    P->>DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = $1
    DB-->>P: user (id, hash)
    P-->>A: user
    A->>A: bcrypt.compare(password, hash)
    A->>A: jwt.sign({ userId }, secret, 7 jours)
    A-->>C: Set-Cookie tg_token (httpOnly, secure, sameSite)
    Note over C,DB: Requêtes suivantes : cookie → requireAuth → where user_id
